  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY:\n{他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\nPair: {揺|ゆ}らぐ (intransitive - to sway, waver)\nPattern: Xを{揺|ゆ}さぶる\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{揺|ゆ}さぶっている - is shaking (action in progress)\n\nUSAGE:\nStronger and more forceful than {揺|ゆ}らす. Implies vigorous or repeated shaking.\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {肩|かた}を{揺|ゆ}さぶる - to shake someone by the shoulders\n- {心|こころ}を{揺|ゆ}さぶる - to move emotionally\n- {信念|しんねん}を{揺|ゆ}さぶる - to shake one's convictions\n\nWATCH OUT:\n{揺|ゆ}さぶられっ{子|こ}{症候群|しょうこうぐん} (shaken baby syndrome) - violent shaking of infants is dangerous.",
